# Grid B — U7 History / Authorship (latest commit diff explanation)
#
# Regression target: a latest-commit diff question must stay as a rich
# commit/diff explanation. It should use VCS provenance and changed-file
# evidence, not collapse to a commit hash/subject scalar and not require
# checkout-path guessing through exec_command.
#
# Ground truth drifts whenever this repository receives a new commit. Keep this
# case focused on answer shape: the answer must discuss the latest commit's diff
# and changed files with a concrete explanation, not just return a commit id.
ID="u7h"
NAME="history — latest commit diff detailed explanation"
QUESTION="根据最近一次提交代码的差异，分析一下具体做了哪些事情，详细描述一下，必要时通过合适的图辅助说明。"
EXPECT_NOT_CONTAINS="**值：**"
EXPECT_MATCHES_REGEX="(提交|commit).*(差异|diff|变更|修改)|(差异|diff|变更|修改).*(提交|commit)
(文件|file|路径|path).*(变更|修改|diff|影响)|(变更|修改|diff|影响).*(文件|file|路径|path)
(具体|详细|说明|分析|做了什么|影响)"
